ze: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;it provides a complete, &lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;pre-configured development environment in the cloud&lt;/strong&gt; that you can access from any browser&lt;/mark&gt;. For individual developers, hobbyists, or students, it removes the headache of local machine setup and lets you start coding instantly.&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;n6owBd awi2gc&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACA4QAA&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 12px 0px 16px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;Every personal GitHub account includes a generous &lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;free monthly quota&lt;/strong&gt; of &lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;60 hours of runtime&lt;/strong&gt; (on a standard 2-core machine) and &lt;strong class=&quot;rQesXe MPyX&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;15 GB of storage&lt;/strong&gt;, making it entirely free for casual side projects and learning.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;yhAwj&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-sfc-inited=&quot;2&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div data-bfc=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwjS85ym7u2WAxU5b2wGHXl1JtsQi4wTegoIAggACAAIEBAA&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAIIAAgACBAQAA&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(10, 10, 10);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;otQkpb&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; data-animation-nesting=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-wiz-attrbind=&quot;aria-level=k4aB2_1d/fLk2Md&quot; data-sfc-root=&quot;ep&quot; data-complete=&quot;true&quot; data-copy-service-computed-style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot; style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Noto Color Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; margin: 24px 0px 12px; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 0px rgb(0, 29, 53);&quot;&gt;Core Benefits for Personal Use&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;KsbFXc U6u95&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-sfc-root=&